# Agent personas

Follow `docs/team.md`. Product shape is `docs/architectural-blueprint.md`. Before building a slice of the portrait, pick **one** persona and read its file. Do not blend roles in one pass.

| Job | Persona |
|-----|---------|
| Scope, allow/deny, ship/block | `docs/personas/charter-editor.md` |
| Find and cite official series | Launch `source-librarian` (`.cursor/agents/source-librarian.md`) |
| States, UTs, districts, boundary changes | `docs/personas/geography-steward.md` |
| Fetch/parse into `data/` | `docs/personas/ingest-engineer.md` |
| Definitions, breaks, lags, disagreement | `docs/personas/methodologist.md` |
| Data vintage: generate / re-generate | `docs/personas/pipeline-engineer.md` |
| Model, refresh contract, serving | `docs/personas/platform-architect.md` |
| Site IA, URLs, SEO, nav, preview vs published HTTP | `docs/personas/front-end-architect.md` + `docs/web-design.md` |
| Visual contract, templates, render, presentation pass | `docs/personas/ui-ux-developer.md` + `docs/design-system.md` |
| Citizen copy and charts | `docs/personas/content-editor.md` + `docs/editorial-guidelines.md` (rule: `content-editor-editorial`) |
| Independent pass/block | Launch `trust-auditor` (`.cursor/agents/trust-auditor.md`) |

The visual contract and civic CMS are UI/UX Developer (`docs/design-system.md`) — not Content Editor restyling, not Front-end Architect inventing chrome. The presentation pass is UI/UX Developer against that file — not Front-end Architect, not Trust, not a fifth Content Editor writing pass. Site IA is Front-end Architect (`docs/web-design.md`) — not UI/UX inventing a slug.

When Content Editor is the active persona, also follow `.cursor/rules/content-editor-editorial.mdc` and read `docs/editorial-guidelines.md`. Do not apply that editorial rule under any other persona.

When Front-end Architect is the active persona, also read `docs/web-design.md`. Do not treat that file as the presentation pass.

When UI/UX Developer is the active persona, also read `docs/design-system.md`. Do not treat that file as site IA or as citizen copy.

First crew: Charter Editor, Source Librarian, Methodologist. When a slice becomes a product, Platform Architect sets the CMS and refresh contract before anyone builds a page. Front-end Architect holds `docs/web-design.md` before UI/UX invents a route. UI/UX Developer holds `docs/design-system.md` before inventing chrome. Trust Auditor before anything a citizen sees. Do not play Source Librarian or Trust Auditor in the parent.
